[block'ORD-0007-json'
  [ctx'the spec of EMS-002','.guidelines/.orders/EMS-002/EMS-002.pgml']
  [tgt'JSON in a crate of its own under every other, question 4 of the EMS-001 return, answered b']
  [ctx'JSON sits in glyph-util, which vocabulary.js and stores.js do not import, so glyph-stores keeps a Value of its own with the same six variants, and the envelope converts one into the other']
  [cnst'the oracle of glyph-json is the platform, JSON.parse and JSON.stringify as the JS engine has them, and its tests are the ones glyph-util held for it']
  [cnst'a floor crate depends on no crate of the workspace, and every crate may depend on it']
  [cnst'no projection moves: a refactor of the Rust under the same oracle']
  [val'the crate','glyph-json holds what glyph_util::json held and replaces the Value of glyph-stores, one JSON type for the workspace']
  [val'the graph','crate-graph.js names glyph-json with its oracle, as the floor every crate may reach and that reaches none, seen failing before it counts']
  [val'the oracle','every crate answers the oracle as before, byte for byte']
];
